   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Offline replay, not the live benchmark.** Each method got **14 days of synthetic history** (the challenge-v1 traffic process with a fresh seed, never the sealed one), followed by about 37 hours of real observations of the simulated challenge workload on prodcluster (from 2026-10-05 06:40Z). Every line shows what that method *would* have done on those observations under **simplified capacity assumptions**: ceil(lead / 600 rpm), bounds 1..12, scale-down after one slot below Ready, reactive catch-up after 2 min; no confidence damping, scheduling or readiness delays. This is not measured live readiness, benchmark evidence or a production recommendation. The live arms are untouched (first real training 2026-10-07 00:00Z).\n\n**Green** S1 pattern \u00b7 **Red** E1 ensemble + q90 \u00b7 **Dark red** E2 + q95 \u00b7 **Blues** LSTM + pattern blends \u00b7 **Purple** LSTM alone \u00b7 **Orange** reactive only \u00b7 **Dashed** actual / required"
   }
  },
